The caller gave the close as 162.85 on 2026-11-12, but the fact sheet dates that close to 2026-11-13. I used the fact sheet's date. I didn't look at NVDA's earlier evaluation, which set the 164.27 entry price, because my instructions limit me to the four input files. The checker raised no consistency problem.
